## 6.4 Statistics Screen

FR-38 … FR-52 are confirmed requirements, implemented via the pure `compute_stats` engine, which accepts an optional pre-built `day_index` (performance optimization, A-18) and an optional notes collection. The Stats screen renders colour-coded `SummaryCard`s grouped into sections: Study time (Today/Week/Month/Lifetime), XP earned (same four periods), Streaks (current/longest, "N day(s)" pluralisation), Medal days (Bronze/Silver/Gold, highest-per-day), and Activity (total sessions, active days, average daily time, **total notes [NEW]**). A friendly empty hint appears below the cards when no sessions exist. All period math uses local dates and start-day attribution; week bounds are Monday–Sunday (`week_bounds`), month bounds first-to-last day (`month_bounds`).

| ID | Requirement | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| FR-38 | The Stats screen displays XP totals for today, this week, this month, and lifetime, plus time totals for each period. | |
| FR-39 | "Today" means the current local calendar day from midnight to midnight. | Based on the system clock. |
| FR-40 | "This week" means Monday through Sunday of the current local calendar week. | Confirmed week definition (A-6). |
| FR-41 | "This month" means the current calendar month from the first day to the last day. | Local system calendar. |
| FR-42 | "Lifetime" means all recorded sessions in the current save data. | No cloud backup or multiple devices implied. |
| FR-43 | Statistics use the same day attribution rule as medals and calendar. | Sessions are counted on their start day. |
| FR-44 | The Stats screen displays current streak and longest streak. | Rules below. |
| FR-45 | The Stats screen displays total hours studied, total sessions, active days, average daily study time, and medal counts. | Plus total notes **[NEW]** (NOTE-15). |
| FR-46 | Medal counts count the highest medal earned per qualifying day; Bronze, Silver, and Gold shown separately. | A-11. |
| FR-47 | A day qualifies for a streak if it has at least 10 minutes of logged study. | A-7. |
| FR-48 | Current streak counts consecutive qualifying days ending today if today qualifies; otherwise ending yesterday. | Prevents the streak from appearing broken before the day ends. |
| FR-49 | Longest streak is the maximum number of consecutive qualifying days in the saved history. | Historical only. |
| FR-50 | Average daily study time is total study time divided by number of active days. | Active day = at least one logged session. |
| FR-51 | Timezone and locale handling uses the local system timezone and calendar. | No timezone selection UI. |
| FR-52 | Date display may follow the Windows regional format where practical. | Internal calculations remain stable and local-date-based. |

