## 10. Save File Data Schema (As Implemented)

The save file is JSON-based. Derived values such as daily totals, medals, streaks, and statistics are computed from sessions at runtime rather than stored as authoritative records. Schema version remains **1**; DATA-1 … DATA-6 hold. The implemented top-level structure adds the `notes` array **[NEW]**:

```json
{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "created_at": "YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS",
  "updated_at": "YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SS",
  "settings": { "theme": "dark", "xp_per_10_minutes": 10 },
  "sessions": [
    {
      "id": "<uuid>",
      "start_local": "<ISO local datetime>",
      "end_local": "<ISO local datetime>",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "created_at_local": "<ISO local datetime>",
      "source": "preset | custom"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "<uuid>",
      "title": "…",
      "body": "…",
      "day": "YYYY-MM-DD | null",
      "created_at_local": "<ISO local datetime>",
      "updated_at_local": "<ISO local datetime>"
    }
  ]
}
```

### 10.1 General Schema Rules

| ID | Requirement | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| DATA-1 | The save file contains a top-level schema version field. | Initial and current version is 1. |
| DATA-2 | The save file contains application settings, session records, and note records. | Derived data is not stored. |
| DATA-3 | The application tolerates missing optional fields by using safe defaults. | Supports forward compatibility and user editing. |
| DATA-4 | Date and time values are stored as local date-time values in ISO-style format. | Serialised via `format_dt`; naive local strings, stable and parseable. |
| DATA-5 | Derived daily medal state is not the primary source of truth. | Medals are calculated from sessions. |
| DATA-6 | Session and note identifiers are unique. | UUID strings; duplicate ids are skipped on load (ERR-21). |

### 10.2 Top-Level Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| schema_version | Integer | Yes | Save file schema version. Value is 1. |
| created_at | Date-time | Optional | Timestamp when the save file was created. |
| updated_at | Date-time | Optional | Timestamp refreshed on every successful save. |
| settings | Object | Yes | User settings and configuration. |
| sessions | Array | Yes | List of session records. Empty on first run. |
| notes | Array | Optional **[NEW]** | List of note records. Missing key loads as an empty list; a non-list value marks the file corrupt. |

### 10.3 Settings Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| theme | String | Yes | dark | Either "dark" or "light"; invalid/missing → "dark". |
| xp_per_10_minutes | Integer | Yes | 10 | XP awarded per completed 10-minute study block; invalid/negative → 10. |

### 10.4 Session Fields

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | String | Yes | Unique session identifier (non-empty). |
| start_local | Date-time | Yes | Local start date and time of the session; must parse. |
| end_local | Date-time | Optional | Local end date and time; derived as start + duration when absent. |
| duration_minutes | Integer | Yes | Total session duration in minutes; must be in (0, 1440] or the record is skipped. |
| created_at_local | Date-time | Optional | Timestamp when the session was logged; defaults to end. |
| source | String | Optional | "preset" or "custom"; unknown values default to "preset". Not required for core logic. |

### 10.5 Note Fields **[NEW]**

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| id | String | Yes | Unique note identifier. |
| title | String | Optional | Note title, clamped to 120 characters on load. |
| body | String | Optional | Free-text body, clamped to 100,000 characters on load. |
| day | Date | Optional | Attached calendar day as plain ISO date (datetime strings accepted and reduced to their date part); `null` = undated; unparsable values yield an undated note rather than a rejected record. |
| created_at_local | Date-time | Optional | Fallback chain: missing created ← updated ← now. |
| updated_at_local | Date-time | Optional | Fallback: missing updated ← created. |

### 10.6 Derived Data Policy

| Derived Data | Stored Persistently? | Calculation Source |
|---|---|---|
| Daily total study time | No | Sessions attributed to the day |
| Daily XP | No | Sessions attributed to the day |
| Daily medal | No | Daily total study time |
| Calendar medal icons | No | Daily medal calculation |
| Calendar note markers | No | Notes grouped by day |
| Today / week / month / lifetime stats | No | Session history |
| Current streak | No | Qualifying day history |
| Longest streak | No | Qualifying day history |
| Medal counts | No | Daily medal history |
| Total notes | No | Notes array |

Files whose overall structure is unusable raise typed errors mapped to friendly messages; a future `schema_version` raises `FutureSchemaError` and is never overwritten.

