Key architectural additions beyond the initial proposal **[NEW]**:

- **AppState as single source of truth** with incremental indexes: `_day_index` (DayAggregate per day), `_sessions_by_day`, `_session_by_id`, `_note_by_id`, `_note_counts_by_day`; rebuilt wholesale only on load/manual-load, updated O(day-size) on mutations; deletion recomputes day XP from remaining sessions because partial-block rounding makes XP non-additive (A-18).
- **Listener pattern**: every mutation notifies registered callbacks; `MainWindow.refresh_all` refreshes only screens already constructed, each under an exception guard (ERR-23).
- **Lazy screen construction** for startup performance (A-20).
- **Test-only path override** (`paths.set_override_data_dir`) enabling hermetic persistence tests and the GUI smoke run.

Module responsibilities (from the initial plan, still accurate): session logic (represent/validate/time stamp), XP engine, medal engine, stats engine, storage service (read/write JSON, backups, corruption recovery, schema protection), resource helper (dev vs packaged asset paths), screens (Home, Calendar, Notes, Stats, Settings), dialogs (custom session entry, day details, note editor, confirmations, messages), and the stopwatch widget.

